	<item>
		<title>[US] Wal-Mart LEGO Black Friday 2026 Deals Now Live: November 23-29, 2026 (Over 10 Sets Discounted)</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-wal-mart-lego-black-friday-2026-deals-now-live-november-23-29-2026-over-10-sets-discounted/</link>
