					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="659" height="762" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Sales-Deals-List.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Wal-Mart US LEGO Black Friday 2026 Sales &amp; Deals List" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Sales-Deals-List.jpg 659w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Sales-Deals-List-259x300.jpg 259w" sizes="(max-width: 659px) 100vw, 659px" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>Walmart US Online LEGO Black Friday 2026 Deals are now officially live! Deals run from November 23-29, 2026</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-wal-mart-lego-black-friday-2026-deals-now-live-november-23-29-2026-over-10-sets-discounted/">[US] Wal-Mart LEGO Black Friday 2026 Deals Now Live: November 23-29, 2026 (Over 10 Sets Discounted)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://howl.link/8iblat2mcr0yo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Walmart US Online</a> LEGO Black Friday 2026 Deals are now officially live! Deals run from November 23-29, 2026 or while supplies last. There are <a href="https://howl.link/i0o9qfs1z3n5q" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over 10 LEGO sets discounted</a> and quite a few of them are even at 50% off! Don&#8217;t delay as they will most likely sell out fast.</p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/i0o9qfs1z3n5q" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115187 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Sales-Deals-List.jpg" alt="" width="659" height="762" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Sales-Deals-List.jpg 659w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Wal-Mart-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-2026-Sales-Deals-List-259x300.jpg 259w" sizes="(max-width: 659px) 100vw, 659px" /></a></p>
<p>Don&#8217;t forget to visit our website regularly and subscribe to our email list so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any future LEGO deals that are in the United States!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<p>We also have a<strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Sales Page Hub</a></strong> too. The <strong>page is updated regularly</strong> so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any bargains. For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="721" height="576" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 721px) 100vw, 721px" /></a></p>
