		<item>
		<title>29 Handpicked &#038; Verified Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for This Morning, November 22, 2026</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/29-handpicked-verified-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-morning-november-22-2026/</link>
