					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/last-day-for-insiders-weekend-2026-new-items-added-for-4x-points-promo-including-star-trek-u-s-s-enterprise-ncc-1701-d-and-spongebob-squarepants-bikini-bottom/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 15:04:37 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks Sales]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales & Deals]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales Canada]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales UK]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales US]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=115173</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="858" height="846" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10356-Star-Trek-U.S.S.-Enterprise-NCC-1701-D-November-2025-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="18+ LEGO Icons 10356 Star Trek U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701-D November 2025 Black Friday Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10356-Star-Trek-U.S.S.-Enterprise-NCC-1701-D-November-2025-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 858w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10356-Star-Trek-U.S.S.-Enterprise-NCC-1701-D-November-2025-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x296.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10356-Star-Trek-U.S.S.-Enterprise-NCC-1701-D-November-2025-Black-Friday-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x757.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 858px) 100vw, 858px" /></p>
<p>Its the last day for Insiders Weekend 2026 at LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124; UK &#124; Australia). Offers run for two days only from</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/last-day-for-insiders-weekend-2026-new-items-added-for-4x-points-promo-including-star-trek-u-s-s-enterprise-ncc-1701-d-and-spongebob-squarepants-bikini-bottom/">Last Day for Insiders Weekend 2026 &#8211; New Items Added for 4x Points Promo Including Star Trek U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701-D and SpongeBob SquarePants Bikini Bottom</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114907 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-Banner-Ad-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="656" height="918" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-Banner-Ad-Logo.jpg 656w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-Banner-Ad-Logo-214x300.jpg 214w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 656px) 100vw, 656px" /></p>
<p>Its the last day for Insiders Weekend 2026 at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). Offers run for two days only from November 21-22, 2026. For those in Australia, Insiders Weekend is already over but there are still several quite a few more hours left for US, Canada and UK. Make sure to log in to your Insiders Rewards Account (free to join) in order to take advantage of the promotions.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-110889 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Icons-11386-SpongeBob-SquarePants-Bikini-Bottom-Fall-September-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="961" height="961" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Icons-11386-SpongeBob-SquarePants-Bikini-Bottom-Fall-September-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Icons-11386-SpongeBob-SquarePants-Bikini-Bottom-Fall-September-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Icons-11386-SpongeBob-SquarePants-Bikini-Bottom-Fall-September-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Icons-11386-SpongeBob-SquarePants-Bikini-Bottom-Fall-September-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Icons-11386-SpongeBob-SquarePants-Bikini-Bottom-Fall-September-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 961px) 100vw, 961px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-110908 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Icons-11386-SpongeBob-SquarePants-Bikini-Bottom-Fall-September-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="987" height="878" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Icons-11386-SpongeBob-SquarePants-Bikini-Bottom-Fall-September-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Icons-11386-SpongeBob-SquarePants-Bikini-Bottom-Fall-September-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x267.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Icons-11386-SpongeBob-SquarePants-Bikini-Bottom-Fall-September-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x911.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Icons-11386-SpongeBob-SquarePants-Bikini-Bottom-Fall-September-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x684.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 987px) 100vw, 987px" /></p>
<p>If you are based in the US or Canada, they have now also added 18+ LEGO Icons 10356 Star Trek: U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701-D and 18+ LEGO Icons 11386 SpongeBob SquarePants: Bikini Bottom to the list of 4x points. This means you&#8217;ll get four times the amount of Insider Points on either of these sets (basically 20% back in LEGO reward dollars). Don&#8217;t forget that there are also gift with purchases and other promos as well! Check out our Insiders Weekend 2026 summary further below.</p>
<p>*For those in the UK, only 18+ LEGO Icons 11386 SpongeBob SquarePants: Bikini Bottom gets 4x the points. 18+ LEGO Icons 10356 Star Trek: U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701-D will only get double points if you are based in the UK.</p>
<ul>
