		<item>
		<title>[US] Target LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 Now Live: Over 190 Sets Discounted</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-target-lego-black-friday-deals-2026-now-live-over-190-sets-discounted/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-target-lego-black-friday-deals-2026-now-live-over-190-sets-discounted/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:22:34 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales & Deals]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales US]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=115166</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="607" height="905" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List-2.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Target US LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 November List 2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List-2.jpg 607w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List-2-201x300.jpg 201w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 607px) 100vw, 607px" /></p>
<p>Target US LEGO Black Friday 2026 Sale is now officially live! You can now save up to 40%</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-target-lego-black-friday-deals-2026-now-live-over-190-sets-discounted/">[US] Target LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 Now Live: Over 190 Sets Discounted</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://howl.link/yj98fqao7u0fd" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115168 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List-2.jpg" alt="" width="607" height="905" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List-2.jpg 607w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List-2-201x300.jpg 201w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 607px) 100vw, 607px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target US</a> LEGO Black Friday 2026 Sale is now officially live! You can now save up to 40% off on a variety of LEGO sets. There are <a href="https://howl.link/jzzgdb3lvkooi" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over 190 sets that you can choose from</a>.</p>
<p>Note that some of the regular prices are lower at <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target US</a> compared to <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO USA</a>. Free shipping on orders above $35 at <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target.com US</a>.<strong> If you have a Target Circle Card, you&#8217;ll save an extra 5% off as well (on top of discounted prices).</strong></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/yj98fqao7u0fd" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115169 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List.jpg" alt="" width="603" height="897" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List.jpg 603w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List-202x300.jpg 202w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 603px) 100vw, 603px" /></a></p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll update you when we have more LEGO Sales &amp; Deals USA offers!</p>
