		<item>
		<title>7 Best LEGO Icons Sets Under $100 USD</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/7-best-lego-icons-sets-under-100-usd/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/7-best-lego-icons-sets-under-100-usd/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Contributor Writer]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 03:44:18 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[18+/Hard to Find Theme]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Availability]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Guides]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Icons]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Resources]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Themes]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=115137</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1920" height="1080" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261121_073732_0000.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="7 Best LEGO Icons Under $100 USD" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261121_073732_0000.png 1920w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261121_073732_0000-300x169.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261121_073732_0000-1024x576.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261121_073732_0000-768x432.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261121_073732_0000-1536x864.png 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px" /></p>
<p>This article was human written by Contributor Writer.  Just when I thought LEGO had reached its peak with</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/7-best-lego-icons-sets-under-100-usd/">7 Best LEGO Icons Sets Under $100 USD</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><em>This article was human written by Contributor Writer. </em></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-115138 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261121_073732_0000.png" alt="" width="1027" height="578" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261121_073732_0000.png 1920w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261121_073732_0000-300x169.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261121_073732_0000-1024x576.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261121_073732_0000-768x432.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261121_073732_0000-1536x864.png 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1027px) 100vw, 1027px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Just when I thought LEGO had reached its peak with the Icons lineup, it released The Lord of the Rings: Minas Tirith. The set blew me away with its magnificence, but the price tag kept me at arm’s length. $649.99 USD is no joke, which is why I searched and found the 7 best LEGO Icons under $100 USD (United States Dollar).</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Sets under $100 USD may not have the grandeur of their more expensive siblings. But trust LEGO to deliver something worthwhile with its Icons release, and that&#8217;s what I’ll cover in this guide.</span></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">Key Takeaways</span></h2>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">The prices may increase or decrease, depending on when the sets go on sale.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">The prices may also differ if you check other authorized resellers like Amazon.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Most sets in this category have less than 1,000 pieces.</span></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Official LEGO Site:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Amazon:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at eBay (Secondary Marketplace):</strong> <a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay USA</a> | <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay Canada</a></li>
</ul>
