<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-104779 size-full" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/18-LEGO-Icons-11389-Project-Hail-Mary-March-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle.jpg" alt="" width="1117" height="739" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/18-LEGO-Icons-11389-Project-Hail-Mary-March-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle.jpg 1117w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/18-LEGO-Icons-11389-Project-Hail-Mary-March-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-300x198.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/18-LEGO-Icons-11389-Project-Hail-Mary-March-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-1024x677.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/18-LEGO-Icons-11389-Project-Hail-Mary-March-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-768x508.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1117px) 100vw, 1117px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Project Hail Mary movie released in the first half of 2026 brought a new dimension to space-themed movies. This is why it came as no surprise that LEGO was jumping on it to produce a set, the Project Hail Mary model.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">One glance at the set and you’ll wonder why the price is low–at least that’s what I thought. It is a captivating space decor with a dynamic display stand that you can crank to simulate the craft’s centrifugal gravity system. Even better, you’ll get the characters Ryland Grace and Rocky as minifigures.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The spaceship model has 830 pieces, and every piece comes together to create a microscale replica of the real ship. It is the perfect set if you are a sci-fi enthusiast or want to give it to someone who is. And yes, it’s for adults, although I would argue you can still get it for a kid who is at least 15 years old.</span></p>
