										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"><em>This article was human written by News Reporter.</em></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-105212 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner.jpg" alt="" width="1173" height="415" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner.jpg 1902w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner-300x106.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner-1024x362.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner-768x272.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner-1536x543.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1173px) 100vw, 1173px" /></p>
<h2>Key Takeaways</h2>
<ul>
<li>A wide range of deals and discounts on 1-day tickets, 1-day flexi-tickets, 2-day tickets, annual passes, overnight stays, short breaks, and more.</li>
<li>No matter when you want to visit, or what the occasion is, there&#8217;s surely a short break option that works for you at LEGOLAND Windsor Resort in the UK.</li>
<li>Looking to visit WinterWonder at the LEGOLAND Deutschland Resort? If so, now may be the time to book, as there are discounts on overnight stays, 1-day tickets, and 1-day flexi-tickets.</li>
