<li><strong>Australia &amp; Asia &#8211; LEGOLAND Discovery Center Tickets at Official Site: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Melbourne, Australia</a><strong> | </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRj/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legolanddiscoverycentre.com%2Fhong-kong%2Fen%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hong Kong, China</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRi" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Osaka, Japan</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-101954 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLand-Discovery-Center-Logo-Banner.jpg" alt="" width="583" height="164" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLand-Discovery-Center-Logo-Banner.jpg 849w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLand-Discovery-Center-Logo-Banner-300x84.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLand-Discovery-Center-Logo-Banner-768x216.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 583px) 100vw, 583px" /></p>
<h3>Buy LEGOLAND Theme Park Tickets Around the World</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>US &#8211; LEGOLAND Theme Park Tickets at Official Site:</strong> <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York</a></li>
<li><strong>UK &amp; Europe &#8211; LEGOLAND Theme Park Tickets at Official Site:</strong> <a href="https://prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqa" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Windsor, United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Billund, Denmark</a> | <a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gunzburg, Germany</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-104724 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Theme-Parks-Resorts-Logo-Banner.jpg" alt="" width="611" height="210" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Theme-Parks-Resorts-Logo-Banner.jpg 611w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Theme-Parks-Resorts-Logo-Banner-300x103.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 611px) 100vw, 611px" /></p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are <span style="text-decoration: underline;">no ads</span> in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="767" height="613" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 767px) 100vw, 767px" /></p>
