					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1230" height="820" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/legoland-coaster-scaled-e1795127755219.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="legoland coaster" decoding="async" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>This article was human written by News Reporter. Key Takeaways Major ticket discounts are available at all three</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/legoland-late-november-2026-promos-deals-discount-tickets-in-usa-california-florida-and-new-york/">LEGOLAND Late November 2026 Promos, Deals &#038; Discount Tickets in USA (California, Florida and New York)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"><em>This article was human written by News Reporter.</em></p>
<h2>Key Takeaways</h2>
<ul>
<li>Major ticket discounts are available at all three LEGOLAND USA Resorts (<a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a>, <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Florida</a>, and <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F">LEGOLAND New York</a>), starting at 50% off.</li>
<li>Enjoy multi-day stays with discounted packages and a buy 2 nights, get a 3rd for free deal at LEGOLAND Florida.</li>
<li>Take advantage of discounted tickets for LEGOLAND&#8217;s Christmas and Holiday Bricktacular events.</li>
</ul>
<p>While November may be ending soon, the deals at LEGOLAND resorts across the USA aren&#8217;t going anywhere. Let&#8217;s go over some of the best late-November 2026 deals, promos, and discounts at LEGOLAND California, Florida, and New York.</p>
<p>Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-102222 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLAND-New-York-Resort-Black-Friday-2025-Deals-800x444-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="800" height="444" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLAND-New-York-Resort-Black-Friday-2025-Deals-800x444-Banner-Logo.jpg 800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLAND-New-York-Resort-Black-Friday-2025-Deals-800x444-Banner-Logo-300x167.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGOLAND-New-York-Resort-Black-Friday-2025-Deals-800x444-Banner-Logo-768x426.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></a></p>
<h2>LEGOLAND California</h2>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-115039" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/legoland-cali.jpg" alt="" width="528" height="378" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/legoland-cali.jpg 528w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/legoland-cali-300x215.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 528px) 100vw, 528px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>Save up to 50% on tickets, as tickets start at $64 per person, compared to $139 per person at the front gate. The offer ends on November 29th, 2026.</li>
<li>Enjoy anytime tickets starting at $139 per person. These let you buy a ticket and use it on any operating day during 2026.</li>
<li>Military members can get access to exclusive savings on LEGOLAND tickets.</li>
<li>Save up to $120 on annual passes, as they start at $139 per pass. The offer ends on November 29th, 2026.</li>
<li>Save up to 50% on hotel + ticket packages, starting at $128 per person per night. Valid for stays from January 3rd to May 28th, 2027. The offer ends on November 29th, 2026.</li>
<li>Enjoy the Ultimate Holiday Sleepover at one of LEGOLAND&#8217;s kid-themed hotels, starting at $144 per person per night.</li>
<li>Build your own vacation and stay your way, with tickets starting at $99 per person per night.</li>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays at Official LEGOLAND Theme Parks Site &amp; See All Promotions: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Whether you&#8217;re looking for discounted tickets, cheaper hotels, or more affordable annual passes, there are plenty of late-November 2026 LEGOLAND California deals for families wanting to spend less ahead of the holidays. I also like the flexibility of the discounted Hotel + Ticket Packages and how they&#8217;re valid for a stay any time from early January to late May 2027, giving families plenty of choices for when they schedule their stay.</p>
<h2>LEGOLAND Florida</h2>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-115040" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/legoland-florida-nov-20.jpg" alt="" width="520" height="384" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/legoland-florida-nov-20.jpg 520w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/legoland-florida-nov-20-300x222.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 520px) 100vw, 520px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>Save up to 60% on tickets, with tickets starting at $49 per person, compared to $129 per person at the front gate. The offer ends on November 29th, 2026.</li>
<li>Enjoy up to $100 off annual passes, as they start at $99 per pass. The offer ends on November 29th, 2026.</li>
<li>Save up to 60% on hotel + ticket packages, starting at $128 per person per night. The offer ends on November 29th, 2026, and is valid for stays between January 1st and May 27th, 2027.</li>
<li>Book 2 nights and enjoy a 3rd night for free, with prices starting at $93 per person per night.</li>
<li>First responders and military personnel get free entry into <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Florida</a> and can save up to 50% on tickets for up to 6 guests visiting with the service member. The offer ends on November 30th, 2026.</li>
<li>Stay your way and build your own vacation, starting at $51 per person per night.</li>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays at Official LEGOLAND Theme Parks Site &amp; See All Promotions: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a></li>
</ul>
<p>The versatility of the deals at <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Florida</a> is worth mentioning, as not only are there discounted tickets and hotel stays, but there are also massive deals on annual passes, a free 3rd night when you book 2 nights, and completely free entry for military personnel and first responders until the end of the month.</p>
<h2>LEGOLAND New York</h2>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-115041" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/legoland-nyc-nov-20.jpg" alt="" width="545" height="366" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/legoland-nyc-nov-20.jpg 545w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/legoland-nyc-nov-20-300x201.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 545px) 100vw, 545px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>Save 50% on theme park tickets, with prices starting at $49 per person, compared to $99 per person at the front gate. This Black Friday offer ends on December 2nd, 2026, and is valid for visits from March 26th to May 23rd, 2027.</li>
<li>Both military members and first responders can enjoy free entry to <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND New York</a> and also get 50% off on tickets for up to 6 guests visiting with them. The offer ends on November 30th, 2026.</li>
<li>Buy now, and visit anytime this season for only $39 per person, compared to $99 per person at the front gate. The ticket must be used by January 2nd, 2027.</li>
<li>Save up to 50% on hotel + ticket packages, starting at $94 per person per night. The offer ends on December 2nd, 2026, and is valid for stays between March 25th and May 28th, 2027.</li>
<li>Have the Ultimate Holiday Sleepover and enjoy access to seasonal events, with prices starting at $114 per person per night.</li>
<li>Save up to $100 on passes, as prices start at $79 per person. This deal ends on December 2nd, 2026.</li>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays at Official LEGOLAND Theme Parks Site &amp; See All Promotions: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a></li>
</ul>
<p>While <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND New York</a> has several great deals right now, I especially love the &#8220;Buy Now, Visit Anytime This Season&#8221;, as it gives you affordable access to the famous and festive Holiday Bricktacular event, which is set to begin on November 27th, 2026.</p>
